  "releaseNotes": "# Changes since version 9.0.0:\n\n## Fixed\n- [Report Templates] Fixed an issue where iterating over an empty JSON array in the bound JSON data could throw an exception instead of skipping the empty array. (DOC-7220)\n- [Fields] Fixed incorrect handling of document paths for RD fields on Linux. (DOC-7223)",
